    ($$A design critique ended with agreement that less chrome would help the words breathe more. The passage stretched across four short sentences so the run felt closer to real writing. Capital letters appeared sparingly yet still demanded a clean shift that did not stall pace. The board updated only if the daily best moved which kept the celebration meaningful.$$),
